Z||000001||theogre||08-21-2001||11:20 PM||||I don't know how you got S-10 out of my cave...<P>read in my cave some more.... The door pin kit part number is in the door service article. MotorMite's red HELP! stuff. It's in stock at more stores than I can list. Any that don't stock it can likely get it. you need 2 kits per door. (Each kit is 2 bushings and a new pin.)<P>The article gives one known online source for the Steck tool for the spring. You may be able to borrow that tool from some parts stores.||||reg||1
