Z||000009||johnmac||08-26-2001||10:32 PM||||Just did my door using Chevy S-10 Pins. The pins are about 1/4" longer than the originals.<P>They will obstruct the removal of the outer door panels screws. I am planning to remove my panel so I didn't fully engage the door pin. After I redo the panel and put back on I will drive home the door pin.<P>Help this will assist you.<P>------------------<BR>John MacHaffie<BR>86GT "Yellowbird"<BR>12+ month project car<BR>johnmac@mpinet.net<BR>Winter Springs, Florida||||reg||1
